'''Bauble''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that was originally obtainable by giving 100 [[Gifts]] {{Currency|Gift}} (equivalent to a total of 80,000 [[Snow Tokens]] {{Currency|Snow Token}}) to players during the [[Christmas Event 2024|2024 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
It’s a red gun with white patterns. It has a golden trigger and a golden star at the right end of the gun. There’s also a red bauble-like sphere in place of the barrel, hence the name.

== Trivia ==
* It has a chroma variant called [[Chroma Bauble]].
* It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife [[Ornament]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Ornament Set|Ornament Set]].
* Unlike [[Chroma Bauble]], Bauble sits more horizontally on the avatar.
* It is the sixth [[Godly Weapons|godly]] weapon to be obtained from gifting, the others being [[Lugercane]], [[Jinglegun]], [[Swirly Blade]], [[Gingermint]], and [[Evergun]].

